# FeaturedStory Builder Component

## Overview

`FeaturedStory` is a featured article card component built for and registered with **Builder Publish**. It is designed to be placed on marketing pages, blog index pages, or any content-driven surface where a single "hero" article needs to stand out.

The card has two primary zones:
1. **Banner** — a full-width colored header area containing an optional badge pill and a large bold title. The background color is fully configurable via a Builder color-picker input, making it easy for content editors to match campaign themes without touching code.
2. **Body** — the content area below the banner, containing the article headline, a short description excerpt, a primary CTA button, and an optional metadata row (estimated read time and category tag).

All inputs are editable in the Builder visual editor, so non-technical content editors can configure every text value, color, and link without needing a developer.

