## Builder Registration

The component is registered in `src/builder-registry.js` inside the `builderCustomComponents` array. This array is passed to the `customComponents` prop on any `<Content />` or `<Section />` component rendered by Builder Publish.

Registration entry name: **`"FeaturedStory"`** — this is the name that appears in the Builder component picker UI.

Each input in the registration maps directly to a React prop, and Builder uses the `type` field to determine which editor control to render (e.g., `"color"` renders a color picker, `"url"` renders a URL input with validation, `"longText"` renders a textarea).

---

## Props / Builder Inputs

All props have sensible defaults so the component renders correctly when first dropped onto a Builder canvas with no configuration.

| Prop | Builder Type | Default Value | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `badge` | `string` | `"FEATURED"` | Short uppercase label displayed in a pill in the top-left of the banner. Set to an empty string to hide the badge entirely. |
| `bannerTitle` | `string` | `"Featured Story"` | Large bold title centered inside the colored banner. Typically a section label like "Featured Story" or "Editor's Pick". |
| `bannerColor` | `color` | `"#0F62FE"` | Background color of the banner zone. Rendered as an inline `style` override on the banner `div` so it can be changed without touching the stylesheet. Any valid CSS color works. |
| `title` | `string` | `"Transforming Enterprise Design Systems..."` | The article headline rendered below the banner. Uses the H3 heading style at 28px. |
| `description` | `longText` | `"Explore how modern design systems..."` | Short excerpt or subtitle for the article. Rendered as body text at 16px in `--text-secondary` color. |
| `ctaText` | `string` | `"Read full story"` | Label for the primary CTA button. |
| `ctaUrl` | `url` | `"#"` | `href` destination for the CTA button. Builder validates this as a URL. |
| `readTime` | `string` | `"5 min read"` | Estimated reading time displayed with a clock icon in the footer meta row. Set to an empty string to hide this item. |
| `category` | `string` | `"Design Systems"` | Article category displayed with a document icon in the footer meta row. Set to an empty string to hide this item. |

